A complete **study-guide.md** file has been created in the workspace with comprehensive coverage of all requested topics:

## Key Sections Included:

1. **Backpropagation** (Section 2) — Mathematical notation, chain rule derivation, step-by-step algorithm, and Python implementation
2. **Gradient Descent Optimization** (Section 3) — Learning rate schedules (cosine/step decay), mini-batch vs full batch variants, loss landscape analysis, and momentum/Adam solutions
3. **Self-Attention Mechanism** (Section 4) — Q/K/V matrix mechanics, scaled dot-product attention formula (QK^T/√d_k) with softmax normalization, multi-head attention architecture, plus implementation code
