5. **Encoder-Decoder Architecture** (Section 6) — Full encoder/decoder structure (multi-head self-attention, FFN, layer norm, residual connections), causal masking, cross-attention, plus complete Python implementations for EncoderLayer, DecoderLayer, and TransformerModel
6. **Practical Study Plan** (Section 7) — 12-week schedule table covering all topics, daily exercises for Weeks 1-4, recommended resources, self-assessment checklist, and capstone project ideas

